        <mxCell id="4" value="Stored: pending_payment, active, expired, payment_failed, payment_rejected, suspended, cancelled. Created and Payment Verification are request steps. Expiring Soon is a derived time condition. Renewed creates a NEW Subscription and Payment; the old object remains expired. Entitlement also checks verified payment and future expiry on every premium request." style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#365b4b;fontColor=#19382e;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;spacing=6;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
